  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 606.11 Tidal Docks: Aquaculture at Marinas",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 606.11 Tidal Docks: Aquaculture at Marinas.\n\n(a) Aquaculture structures shall be installed within existing legal boat slips.\n\n(b) Aquaculture structures that extend outside the footprint of the originally permitted docking structure and associated boat slip(s) shall:\n\n(1) Constitute a modification of the approved docking structure; and\n\n(2) Meet the requirements of Env-Wt 603.02.\n\n(c) If the department approves a proposed aquaculture structure, the department shall submit the approval to the governor and executive council for review as provided in RSA 482-A:3, II.\n\nSource. #12806, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt600.html"
